Using the same dataset from Exercise 1:

a. Apply hierarchical clustering with single, complete, average, and Ward's linkage.
b. Cut each dendrogram at $k = 3$ and compare the resulting cluster assignments.
c. Which linkage method produces clusters most similar to the $k$-means solution? You can perform that qualitatively or quantitatively using the adjusted Rand index ([Python](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.metrics.adjusted_rand_score.html); [R](https://search.r-project.org/CRAN/refmans/mclust/html/adjustedRandIndex.html)).
d. Which linkage method would you recommend for clinical data and why?

::: {.callout-note collapse="true" title="Solution"}
